  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CaLP Middle East Programme</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project involves establishing a Cash Learning Partnership (CaLP) regional office in the Middle East, in order to respond to the demands of humanitarian actors, to act as a catalyst for change and to adapt CaLP&apos;s 4 strategic priorities (capacity building, knowledge management, policy and co -ordination) to the specificities of the regional context.  Activities will include CaLP -led training courses, developing specialist modules and e -learning, capacity building of national and international organisations, training of trainers, operational research and case studies, hosting learning events, creation of national working groups, awareness training and an annual &quot;State of the World&quot; cash report.</narrative>
  </description>
